<title>NEW ZEALAND: RTRS-Cricket-England win 2nd test vs NZ by innings.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-England win 2nd test vs NZ by innings.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>England won the second test against New Zealand by an innings and 68 runs after lunch on the last day on Monday when they dismissed the home side for 191.</p>
<p>The first test of the three-match series was drawn.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand 124 (D.Patel 45, D.Gough 5-40, A.Caddick 4-45) and 191 (B.Young 56, B.Pocock 64. R.Croft 3-19, D.Gough 4-42).</p>
<p>England 383 (N.Hussain 64, G.Thorpe 108, J.Crawley 56, A.Stewart 52, S.Doull 5-75).</p>
</text>
